WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Here's how to film a match we can analyse.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Put your phone on a tripod behind one baseline,
as high as you safely can.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Turn it sideways and record in 1080p
at 60 frames per second.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check that all four court corners are on screen.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Avoid filming towards the sun.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Start recording before the first serve. That's it.
